msgid "Pan and Zoom Bar Controls"
msgstr ""

#: /node/453
msgid ""
"Gives user ability to pan and zoom, with a full zoom bar in the map "
"interface.  Do not use with Pan Zoom Contols or Zoom Panel Controls."
msgstr ""

