"aktualizaci modulu spusťte <a href=\"@update-php\">aktualizační skript</a>."

msgid ""
"If you are upgrading to a newer version of Drupal or upgrading contributed "
"modules or themes, you may need to run the <a href=\"@update-php\">update "
"script</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pokud aktualizujete Drupal na novější verzi, nebo aktualizujete moduly nebo "
